			"Message": "style(Worker): Apply consistent formatting across ESBuild config and service worker source\n\nStandardize whitespace and property ordering in the Worker ESBuild configuration files (Target.js, Worker.js in both Configuration/ and Source/Configuration/) and Service Worker source files (Worker.ts, Worker/Register.ts). Add blank lines between object properties and import statements, align JSDoc comments, and ensure consistent styling with the project's PascalCase codebase conventions.\n\nNo functional changes — this is a pure formatting pass to improve code readability and maintain consistency across the ESBuild configuration pipeline and Service Worker implementation.",
